        },
        "QuestionDescription": "Welcome Thank you for taking part in this study. In this session you will look at an AI system's pre",
        "QuestionText": "<h2>Welcome</h2><p>Thank you for taking part in this study. In this session you will look at an AI system's predictions and explanations, and answer a few short questions about them.</p><p>Your participation is voluntary and your responses are kept anonymous. You may stop at any time without penalty.</p>",
        "QuestionText_Unsafe": "<h2>Welcome</h2><p>Thank you for taking part in this study. In this session you will look at an AI system's predictions and explanations, and answer a few short questions about them.</p><p>Your participation is voluntary and your responses are kept anonymous. You may stop at any time without penalty.</p>",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
