        "QuestionText_Unsafe": "<div><strong>Practice trial 3 of 10</strong> — instance 2</div><p>This is a practice round: you will see feedback after answering. Study the interface below, then answer the questions.</p><div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden;\"><iframe src=\"https://lucas1213wzy.github.io/xaikit-test-ui-apparatus/global/iframe.html?appId=mushrooms&amp;instanceId=2&amp;modelName=mlp&amp;xaiType=LR&amp;LRVariant=dense&amp;showPrediction=1\" data-natural-width=\"1280\" data-natural-height=\"900\" style=\"width:100%;height:700px;border:1px solid #ccc;\" allow=\"fullscreen\"></iframe></div>",
